      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Inflation ki exact definition: Yeh ek sustained aur general increase hai prices ka, jo commodities aur services mein hota hai over a period of time. Matlab ek-do din ki price badhotri nahi, continuous trend hona chahiye. Aur sirf ek cheez nahi, bahut saari cheezein mahagi ho rahi hain."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Matlab agar sirf petrol ka price badha aur baaki sab same hai, to wo inflation nahi?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Bilkul sahi samjhe! Sirf ek item ka price fluctuation ko inflation nahi kehte. Jab overall price level badhta hai across the economy — vegetables, petrol, clothes, medicines sabka — tab inflation hota hai. Aur ye ek-two months ki baat nahi, sustained hona chahiye. BPSC mein yahi definition ka trap aata hai!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Achhaaaa... to sustained + general increase = Inflation!"
        }
      ],
      "navigation": {
