          "text": "Ab samajhte hain inflation KYUN hota hai! Based on causes, teen main types hain: 1) Demand-Pull Inflation, 2) Cost-Push Inflation, aur 3) Built-in Inflation. BPSC aur UPSC dono mein yahi classification important hai."
