          "text": "Ab ek advanced concept — STAGFLATION! Ye combination hai stagnation (economic slowdown) aur inflation ka. Matlab economy grow nahi kar rahi, unemployment badh raha hai, LEKIN prices bhi badh rahe hain! Ye sabse dangerous situation hai. 1970s mein USA ne ye face kiya tha oil crisis ke time."
