      "type": "chat",
      "concept_id": "direct_tax_detail",
      "level": 4,
      "progress": {
        "current": 26,
        "total": 65
      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "DIRECT TAX: Jis person/entity ki income/wealth par tax lagta hai, wahi pay bhi karta hai. Burden shift nahi hota. Examples: Income Tax (salary/business income par), Corporate Tax (companies ke profit par), Property Tax, Wealth Tax (ab abolished), Capital Gains Tax. Ye progressive hote hain — zyada kama rahe ho to zyada tax."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Sir progressive matlab?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Progressive Tax System: Jiska income zyada, uska tax rate bhi zyada. Example: ₹5 lakh income par 20% tax, ₹10 lakh par 30% tax. Ye equity/fairness laata hai — rich log apni capacity ke hisaab se zyada contribute karte hain. India ka income tax progressive hai. ⭐ BPSC TRE Favorite concept!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Achhaaaa! To ameer log zyada percentage mein tax dete hain!"
        }
      },
      "navigation": {
        "next": "card_27_indirect_tax_detail",
        "button_text": "Indirect Tax Samjho ➔"
