      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Ab aata hai GST (Goods and Services Tax) — India ka biggest tax reform! July 1, 2017 se implement hua. Isse pehle bahut saare alag-alag indirect taxes the — VAT, Service Tax, Excise, Entry Tax, Luxury Tax — total 17+ taxes! GST ne sabko replace kar diya. 'One Nation, One Tax' ka dream realize hua!"
