          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Matlab pehle bohot confusion tha, ab ek hi GST hai?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! Lekin GST bhi teen types ka hai: CGST (Central GST — jab goods/services same state mein bechte ho), SGST (State GST — same state), IGST (Integrated GST — jab different states ke beech transaction ho). Example: Bihar se Delhi mein sale = IGST. Bihar ke andar sale = CGST + SGST. ⭐ BPSC TRE Favorite!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Achhaaaa! To intra-state = CGST+SGST, inter-state = IGST!"
